    "UIName": "Arachnid Z",
    "Id": "mechdef_arachnid_ARD-Z",
    "Name": "Arachnid Z",
    "Details": "Once the news of the new Arachnid design reached the Society, they could of course not let some upstarts in the Inner Sphere beat them in 'Mech development and therefore started a refitting project. The first result was the Z version, mounting three Large Supra Lasers, two Hyper Velocity AC/20 and two Large ER Pulse lasers, and the Superheavy variant of the Torso mounted Cockpit. The design struggles with heat buildup from its weapons, but this is not unusual for the Society's designs and just something any piloting MechWarrior will have to adapt to.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Intimidating</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.47</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_arachnid"
  },
